WEBVTT

00:01.218 --> 00:03.339
Welcome back to the Engine Room Records

00:03.400 --> 00:04.360
Planetarium!

00:09.023 --> 00:13.727
Having crossed the Roche limit, the structural

00:13.767 --> 00:17.909
integrity of our satellite has officially

00:18.049 --> 00:18.550
failed.

00:21.652 --> 00:23.733
We are now experiencing terminal

00:23.873 --> 00:27.896
fragmentation as tidal forces overcome

00:28.016 --> 00:30.158
gravitational self-attraction.

00:32.603 --> 00:34.945
The celestial body shatters into a

00:35.085 --> 00:37.608
high-velocity debris field!

00:43.994 --> 00:48.579
Please remain seated. Embrace.

00:52.903 --> 00:54.645
For immediate impact.

01:39.046 --> 01:41.628
The ground is cracking right beneath my boots.

01:43.969 --> 01:46.290
We're ripping up the foundation, pulling the

01:46.310 --> 01:51.633
roots. The sky is falling in a million jagged

01:51.653 --> 01:56.676
pieces. The pressure building up and it never

01:56.736 --> 01:57.777
releases.

01:59.918 --> 02:04.701
I look up and the moon is ripped in half. Nothing

02:04.821 --> 02:08.123
left to do but watch it burn and laugh.

02:10.751 --> 02:13.313
The gravity is dead, the center cannot hold The

02:13.373 --> 02:15.976
chorus spilling out a story never told It's

02:16.036 --> 02:18.638
raining heavy metal from a shattered sky Kiss

02:18.658 --> 02:21.421
the quiet sanctuary a bitter goodbye

02:21.501 --> 02:26.505
Fragmentation, we're blowing it apart A

02:26.585 --> 02:31.150
million flying pieces of a heavy metal heart

02:31.970 --> 02:37.972
FRAGMENTATION! WELCOME TO THE CRASH! TURNING

02:38.152 --> 02:42.514
ALL THE HISTORY TO CINDERS AND TO ASH! WE'RE

02:42.574 --> 02:45.135
LIVING IN THE MIDDLE OF A DEBRIS FIELD! NO

02:45.175 --> 02:49.196
BLASTERS! NO SHELTER! NO SHIELD!

02:49.797 --> 02:51.097
FRAGMENTATION!

02:55.179 --> 02:57.600
I CAN SEE THE BLACK GUITARS FALLING THROUGH THE

02:57.620 --> 03:05.965
